msgstr "執行器驗證權杖"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/integrations_live.ex:102
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Check the GitLab URL and runner authentication token."
msgstr "請檢查 GitLab URL 和執行器驗證權杖。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/integrations_live.html.heex:289
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Create a GitLab runner with your Tuist profile tags, disable untagged jobs, and paste its token here. Select the machine in your pipeline with tags such as [tuist-macos]."
msgstr "使用您的 Tuist 設定檔標籤建立 GitLab 執行器、停用無標籤作業，並將其權杖貼到此處。在您的管線中使用 [tuist-macos] 等標籤選取機器。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/integrations_live.html.heex:268
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Run GitLab CI jobs on Tuist runners. Choose a machine for each job using pipeline tags."
msgstr "在 Tuist 執行器上執行 GitLab CI 作業。使用管線標籤為每個作業選擇機器。"

#: lib/tuist_web/live/integrations_live.ex:328
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The selected repository is not accessible to this account's GitHub App installation."
msgstr "此帳戶嘅 GitHub App 安裝無法存取所選嘅儲存庫。"

